{"id": "EUVD-2026-101732", "enisaUuid": "6e98fdb3-c627-3d84-a7aa-d03d8df8c0d6", "description": "n8n before 1.123.83, 2.41.4, and 2.42.1 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in the file-preview modal, which re-publishes binary data as an unsandboxed same-origin blob URL. A member who uploads a crafted item can run script in the n8n origin of whoever previews it, typically the owner, and act with their session.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T22:52:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T15:41:35", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:A/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/security/advisories/GHSA-29xw-66fq-4xc3", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/n8n-before-1.123.83-2.41.4-and-2.42.1-stored-xss-via-binary-data-file-preview"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m7pg-rcp8-66vv", "CVE-2026-110849"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1fdf0513-a4f6-3eb0-9b76-a07163fe9665", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.123.83"}, {"id": "9658876b-de91-3dc2-a752-37ef5f624e47", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.42.0 <2.42.1"}, {"id": "a0593529-1c05-3d6a-b9af-d257629cef3a", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.41.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b466b5c2-0ed7-3d48-bfd2-c25f8cc1053b", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}], "isExploited": false}